      "explanation": {
        "en": "Expresses a gradual transition or transformation from one state/ability to another over time:\n- Preceded by verbs expressing potential, natural state, or non-volitional actions (e.g., 読めるようになる = become able to read; わかるようになる = come to understand; 食べなくなる = stop eating / become unable to eat).\n- Unlike ようにする, the speaker is NOT asserting personal moment-to-moment control, but observing an emergent capacity or transformation.",
