    "titleMy": "現代人のライフスタイルと休養の知恵 (Modern Lifestyle & The Wisdom of Rest) (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "titleMyanmar": "現代人のライフスタイルと休養の知恵 (Modern Lifestyle & The Wisdom of Rest) (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "translationMy": "In modern society chased by everyday work and studies, the ways of spending days off vary per person. However, people who shut themselves in rooms on exhausted days off and do nothing but gaze at smartphones are not few. Constantly looking at screens tires the eyes, and conversely fatigue may accumulate.\n\nTo restore true health and vitality, ingenuity to rest mind and body proactively is indispensable. For instance, on fine weekends, nothing beats taking a walk in a nearby lush green park. By bathing in sunlight and moving the body lightly, one is naturally freed from everyday stresses that tend to be biased.\n\nMoreover, regarding meals, rather than eating only instant food because it is handy, cooking warm meals with balanced nutrition for oneself is best. And at night, nothing beats soaking in a lukewarm bath and getting ample sleep. Time spent confronting one's own body and mind is precisely what brings vitality for tomorrow."
