    "translationMy": "Director: Dear volunteers, thank you very much for participating in today's training session for the new civic art museum.\nDocent: Director, on the occasion of the public opening next week, are there any particular points we should pay attention to along the tour route?\nDirector: Yes. Taking the renewal opening as an impetus, we introduced an audio guide smartphone app. We anticipate that many visitors will use this app.\nDocent: I see. It seems there will be more opportunities to receive questions from visitors who do not know how to operate it.\nDirector: Exactly. Please kindly guide visitors on reception procedures and precautions, and support them so everyone can enjoy the exhibits with peace of mind."
