    "transcript": "木村：田中さん、新しくチームリーダーに就任した小林さんの様子はどうですか。\n田中：真面目に取り組んでいますが、少し一人で仕事を抱え込みすぎているように見えます。\n木村：そうですね。先輩である私たちの視点から見ると、もっとメンバーに仕事を任せてもよいと思えますね。\n田中：ええ。ただ、入社三年目で急にリーダーを任された小林さんにしてみれば、失敗できないという強い重圧を感じているのでしょう。\n木村：確かに彼の立場にしたら、責任感の強さゆえに全部自分で確認しないと不安なのかもしれませんね。\n田中：はい。彼の気持ちに配慮しながら、頼りやすいサポート体制を整えてあげましょう。",
    "translation": "Kimura: Tanaka-san, how does Kobayashi-san seem since becoming the new team leader?\nTanaka: He is working very diligently, but it looks like he is shouldering a bit too much work all by himself.\nKimura: I agree. From the perspective of us seniors, we feel he could entrust tasks more to team members.\nTanaka: Yes. However, for Kobayashi-san, who was abruptly assigned leadership in just his third year at the company, he is probably feeling immense pressure that he cannot fail.\nKimura: Indeed, in his shoes, out of a strong sense of responsibility, he might feel anxious unless he checks everything himself.\nTanaka: Right. While showing consideration for his feelings, let's set up a supportive environment where it is easy for him to ask for help.",
