      "pattern": "〜べきだ / 〜べきではない",
      "meaning": "should ... / must ... (as moral/social duty); should not ...",
      "formation": "Verb [Dictionary Form] + べきだ / べきではない (Note: する → すべきだ / するべきだ)",
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Expresses that doing or not doing something is a natural social, moral, or professional duty and common-sense standard. It reflects objective ethical principles rather than immediate legal compulsion. Often used in giving principled advice or expressing civic responsibility.",
        "my": "လူမှုကျင့်ဝတ်၊ မူဘောင် သို့မဟုတ် အများသဘောအရ \"ထိုသို့ပြုလုပ်သင့်သည်/မပြုလုပ်သင့်ပါ\" ဟု စာရိတ္တနှင့် တာဝန်ဝတ္တရားဆိုင်ရာ အကြံပြုချက်၊ ဆုံးမချက်အဖြစ် ဖော်ပြသည်။"
      },
      "examples": [
        {
          "sentenceId": "n3.l24.s003",
          "note": "Citizens should observe the laws established by society"
        },
        {
          "sentenceId": "n3.l24.s008",
          "note": "Business corporations must strictly comply with regulations"
        }
      ],
      "similarGrammarIds": [],
