    "titleMyanmar": "Official Public Notice: Community Cultural Center Grand Reopening (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "translationMy": "Notice: Midori Citizens Cultural Center Grand Reopening & Commemorative Programs\nFollowing extensive renovations over approximately one year, our center will reopen on the 1st of next month with refreshed facilities. This renovation has promoted barrier-free access throughout the building, while establishing a multipurpose hall with modern acoustics and a multilingual information desk.\nTo celebrate the reopening, we will host diverse commemorative programs supporting cultural activities throughout the year. We are planning numerous events enjoyable across generations, starting with traditional performing arts like Noh and Kyogen, alongside local cooking workshops. Furthermore, the civic gallery will host ongoing exhibitions by local artists, free for all visitors to inspect.\nParticipant registration for workshops begins this weekend online and at the general inquiry desk. We warmly await your visit as a venue for rich cultural exchange."
