    "titleMy": "Crisis Management and the Tough Call on Product Launch (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "titleMyanmar": "Crisis Management and the Tough Call on Product Launch (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "translationMy": "With the launch of the new product just one week away, critical news arrived from the quality management department. A defect had been discovered in the product's battery control program that causes abnormal overheating under extremely rare conditions.\n\nThe sales department had already launched a large-scale advertising campaign and strongly wished to proceed with the release as scheduled. However, one cannot afford to release a product to market while overlooking a grave flaw that affects consumer safety. If an accident were to occur, the corporate trust built over many years would be lost in an instant.\n\nAfter fierce debate at the executive meeting, the president made the painful decision: \"Unless the safety of the product is completely proven, we have no choice but to postpone the launch.\" There is a mountain of challenges to handle, including apologies to customers with reservations and compensation for business partners. However, in order to fulfill corporate social responsibility, one cannot compromise safety in favor of short-term profit."
