    "translationMy": "In modern business environments, professionals are required to advance multiple projects in parallel rather than merely focusing on a single task. Business people must secure time for future new initiatives and self-development while steadily executing routine duties. In these circumstances, the ability to plan step-by-step procedures by discerning correct priorities and sequence is essential. Furthermore, taking advantage of attending external seminars or client meetings to simultaneously conduct local market research demonstrates a valuable proactive attitude. Maintaining a long-term perspective while taking daily incremental steps is the key to sustainable growth."
