    "titleMy": "Psychological Traps and Preventive Mindset in Stress Management (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "titleMyanmar": "Psychological Traps and Preventive Mindset in Stress Management (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "translationMy": "In our busy modern society, many business people accumulate stress without realizing it. When excessive fatigue piles up, even normally gentle individuals find emotional control difficult, becoming easily irritable toward small mistakes. Such psychological shifts tend to advance unnoticed. Although one might initially downplay it as mild tiredness, continuing work without rest risks causing poor concentration and severe health disorders. To maintain health, one must remain alert to early signs of mental and physical fatigue, proactively taking leave rather than viewing extreme endurance as a virtue."
  },
