    "translationMy": "Sato: Kobayashi-san, ever since our company adopted the cloud system, our way of working has truly changed dramatically.\nKobayashi: Yes, I completely agree. Previously, every time we needed internal approval, we had to stamp paper documents and walk around departments.\nSato: Now, even during business trips or telework, we can approve things instantly via smartphone. Time efficiency has risen remarkably.\nKobayashi: However, while it is convenient, every time I look at chat tools, notifications pile up, and I feel chased by replies even more than before.\nSato: That is true. Using the system’s spread as an opportunity, we also need to re-examine work boundaries such as rules for messaging after hours."
