      "pattern": "〜を通じて / 〜を通して",
      "meaning": "throughout (a time period) / through the medium of ...",
      "formation": "Noun + を通じて / を通して (Noun + を通じた / を通した + Noun)",
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Has two principal usages: (1) Temporal continuity throughout an entire period or season (e.g. 四季を通じて: throughout all four seasons); (2) Medium or agency, indicating that an outcome, relationship, or information was acquired through a specific intermediary, person, or method.",
