    "titleMy": "Modern Wage System Reform: Performance vs Seniority Based on Data (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "titleMyanmar": "Modern Wage System Reform: Performance vs Seniority Based on Data (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "translationMy": "In Japanese employment practices, the seniority wage system valuing age and years of service was standard for decades. However, with demographic aging and intensifying market competition, companies transitioning to merit-based systems grounded in objective performance data have increased rapidly. Under new HR evaluation systems, duties and responsibilities are clearly defined, evaluating employees fairly based on objective data regardless of age. Compensation and promotions are determined corresponding to abilities and actual results. Yet, excessive performance pressure risks undermining teamwork. Thus, flexible systems incorporating diverse criteria like mentoring and operational improvements are essential."
